                    <p class="editable-text" data-section="237" data-text="180">Matteo Moretti, Alessandro's son, takes the helm, expanding the house's offerings while preserving its artisanal soul.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
