                    <p class="editable-text" data-section="240" data-text="182">A dedicated bespoke atelier opens in London's Mayfair, bringing SARTOR's craftsmanship to a new generation of British clientele.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Timeline Item 5 -->
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="241">
