                    <p class="editable-text" data-section="243" data-text="184">Under the creative direction of Elena Moretti-Vass, the fourth generation, SARTOR continues to evolve while honoring its century-old legacy of excellence.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

